    "final_answer": "I found the answer. Let me record the key information:\n\n**Project Found: SoAIHQ/gpt-oss-20b-VISION-GGUF**\n\nKey information from the page:\n- **Name**: gpt-oss-20b-VISION-GGUF\n- **Creator**: SoAIHQ (with base model by OpenAI)\n- **Task**: Text Generation (NLP)\n- **License**: apache-2.0 (open-source)\n- **Updated**: 1 minute ago (most recent in the Text Generation filter)\n- **Tags**: Text Generation, GGUF, llama.cpp, multimodal, image-text-to-text, conversational\n- **Description**: \"A GGUF build of gpt-oss-20b by OpenAI for llama.cpp and the apps built on it, including SoAI. It runs on the CPU, the GPU or both. The weights are the original release, unchanged, and SoAI tested the build before publishing it.\"\n\n---\n\n## Final Answer\n\n**Project Name:** SoAIHQ/gpt-oss-20b-VISION-GGUF\n\n**Creator:** SoAIHQ (the underlying gpt-oss-20b model is by OpenAI)\n\n**Description / Functionality:**\nThis is a GGUF-formatted build of OpenAI's `gpt-oss-20b` open-weight reasoning model, packaged for use with `llama.cpp` and compatible applications (such as SoAI). It functions as a text generation (NLP) model with reasoning capabilities and experimental image input (multimodal). Key features include:\n- **Parameters**: 21B total / 3.6B active (Mixture-of-Experts architecture: 32 experts, 4 active)\n- **Context window**: 131,072 tokens (128K)\n- **Reasoning**: Always-on, with configurable effort (low / medium / high)\n- **Capabilities**: Text generation, image-text-to-text, conversational, tool calling\n- **Hardware**: Runs on CPU, GPU, or both (4-bit quantized with MXFP4, ~13.8 GB)\n- **License**: Apache-2.0 (open-source)\n- **Last updated**: ~1 minute prior to the search (the most recently updated NLP/Text Generation model on Hugging Face at the time of the query)\n\n**How I found it:** I navigated to Hugging Face → Models → applied the Sort: \"Recently updated\" → filtered by the \"Text Generation\" task (the core NLP task category) → the top result was SoAIHQ/gpt-oss-20b-VISION-GGUF, updated 1 minute ago.",
